    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of explicability and transparency, while we have a no copyleft GPL contamination policy and use standard licenses like Apache 2.0, MIT, and LGPL v2.1, we should clarify how the solution will provide transparent recommendations and ensure human oversight in the decision-making process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, based on we company context, we appear to be compliant with the required regulations, but we must carefully review the specific requirements of The tender and ensure that the solution meets all the necessary standards for GDPR, sovereignty constraints, explicability, and transparency." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The global budget for the project is 3 million euros over 4 years, with an annual cost of exploitation that must remain compatible with the local authority's budgetary capacities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we optimize costs while guaranteeing the quality of service expected, and what is we projected margin on this contract?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To optimize costs, we can consider we standard pricing model, which includes a target gross margin percentage of 28% and a minimum acceptable margin percentage of 18%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given that The global budget for the project is 3 million euros over 4 years, this translates to an average annual cost of 750,000 euros. we current financials indicate an average annual revenue of approximately 3.95 million euros over the last three years and a net profit margin of around 9% based on we reference year financials." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
