    <http://example.org/node/chunk165> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "# Executive Summary Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a consortium of specialized agents, is pleased to submit this tender proposal for the implementation of an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in municipal agents daily missions. an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions integrates with existing business software, electronic management of documents, and user directories, ensuring seamless continuity of processing between agents and services. # Understanding of Requirements The City of Belval requires a solution that provides intelligent assistance tools to municipal agents, accessible from municipal agents work environment, to facilitate access to information, improve the quality of answers, and reduce processing times. an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions must cover functionalities such as assistance with consultation of information, drafting, instruction of files, and collaboration and continuity of processing. # Proposed Solution an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions utilizes a technical architecture designed by Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a consortium of specialized agents Technical Architect Agent, integrating with existing systems of information through API standards such as REST, GraphQL, and SOAP." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk166> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a consortium of specialized agents leverage hosting partners like OVHCloud and Scaleway, which use 100% renewable energy, ensuring low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk167> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l., a consortium of specialized agents Security Compliance Agent ensures that an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions complies with regulatory requirements, including GDPR, with data hosted exclusively in the European Union, protected through encryption or anonymization if necessary." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

