        ex:hasText "The AI Innovation Agent proposes the use of Mistral 7B Instruct, a sovereign model that complies with the European Union regulations, with fine-tuning capabilities using LORA, QLoRA, and full fine-tune on domain-specific corpora. an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents in their daily missions includes explainable AI services using SHAP, LIME, and source citation for transparency and trustworthiness." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk169> a prov:Entity ;
