        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk61> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's PM methodologies and past public sector references, how can our company's ensure that our company's tender response meets the client's needs and expectations?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk62> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure that our tender response meets The City of Belval needs and expectations, our company's can leverage our company's experience in managing large-scale public sector projects, such as the digital workplace transformation for Comune di Torino and the AI-powered document management system for Regione Lombardia.  our company's project management capabilities, including PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, and SAFe methodologies, will enable our company's to deliver an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents within the 4-year project duration and 3 million euro budget. our company's can also draw on our company's experience in leading consortia, having led 8 consortia with up to 5 partners, to assemble a team that meets the client's requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk63> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the importance of sovereignty and data protection, our company's can propose hosting an artificial intelligence solution to assist municipal agents on a SecNumCloud-type infrastructure, which aligns with our company's known partner EuroCloud Solutions S.A.'s expertise in sovereign cloud hosting. our company's past experience in managing public sector projects also demonstrates our company's ability to ensure regulatory compliance and data protection, as required by the client." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk64> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure compatibility with The City of Belval budgetary capacities, our company's can offer a phased delivery approach, as outlined in our company's typical delivery structure, which includes inception and design, pilot, full rollout, and operations and support phases. a phased delivery approach, as outlined in our typical delivery structure, which includes inception and design, pilot, full rollout, and operations and support phases will enable our company's to provide a clear understanding of the costs associated with each phase and ensure that the annual cost of exploitation remains within the client's budget." ;
