        ex:hasText "Functional scope The expected solution will have to cover the following functionalities: 3.1 Assistance with the consultation of information The expected solution will have to allow the agents to access quickly to reliable and up-to-date information coming from: the internal procedures, the applicable regulatory texts, the internal documents (guides, notes, repositories)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk70> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Nexus Engineering S.r.l., has experience with cloud providers that include OVHcloud, Scaleway, and Outscale (SecNumCloud), all of which are the EU-based and can meet the hosting requirement on SecNumCloud-certified infrastructure. our also have expertise in containerization using Docker, Kubernetes (K8s), and Helm, which can help ensure high availability and scalability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk71> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To integrate with existing systems of information, including business softwares, electronic management of documents, and user directories, our can leverage our experience with API standards such as REST, GraphQL, and SOAP, as well as API gateways like Kong and Apigee. our also have knowledge of identity providers like Active Directory / LDAP, Keycloak, and FranceConnect, which can facilitate integration with user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk72> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For high availability, our can design an architecture that utilizes load balancing, auto-scaling, and redundancy to ensure a 99.9% uptime. our experience with monitoring tools like Prometheus, Grafana, and ELK stack can help detect and respond to issues quickly." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk73> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding the time of response, our technical expertise in optimizing performance, combined with the use of efficient infrastructure and caching mechanisms, should allow our to meet the requirement of a response time lower than 2 seconds." ;
