    <http://example.org/node/chunk74> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To minimize dependency on non-European suppliers, our can focus on using open-source or European-based solutions for our technology stack. our experience with IaC tools like Terraform and Ansible can help ensure consistent and repeatable deployments on EU-based infrastructure." ;
