        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk80> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a Security and Compliance Officer at Nexus Engineering S.r.l., I can confirm that Nexus Engineering S.r.l. has experience with the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR) and has implemented measures to ensure compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk81> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed, and a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed contact information is dpo@nexus-engineering.it." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk82> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. standard data residency policy ensures that all data is stored within the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk83> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To protect data, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. utilize anonymization tools such as Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) and custom NER models." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. also have a cross-border transfer policy that prohibits transfers by default unless there's an explicit legal basis." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding automated decision-making, Nexus Engineering S.r.l." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "AI security controls include output PII redaction, adversarial input detection, and confidence threshold escalation, which can help identify potential issues before potential issues lead to automated decisions without agent validation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Moreover, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. have a robust access control system in place with multi-factor authentication (MFA) enforced through TOTP and hardware tokens (FIDO2), ensuring that only authorized agents can interact with the system." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To further ensure compliance with the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR) requirements, Nexus Engineering S.r.l. incident response plan includes a Security Incident Response Team (SIRT) and procedures for breach notification within 72 hours." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Nexus Engineering S.r.l. also conduct regular Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIA) to identify and mitigate potential risks, which typically take around three weeks to complete." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The generated contents will have to be adapted to the administrative context and compliant with the requirements of quality expected. 3.3 Assistance with the instruction of files The expected solution will have to be in measure to assist the agents in the analysis and the processing of files, by: proposing relevant information, recalling the applicable rules, suggesting actions or verifications to carry out." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given these existing controls and measures, I believe Nexus Engineering S.r.l. can meet the security and regulatory requirements specified, including strict the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR) compliance, data hosting exclusively in the EU, appropriate data protection through encryption or anonymization, and ensuring that no automated decisions are made without explicit agent validation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires compliance with various regulations, including GDPR and sovereignty constraints." ;
