    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we context, we have experience with GDPR and EU regulations. we standard legal basis for processing personal data is Article 6(1)(e) – performance of task in public interest, and we have a DPA template version 3.2 available. we also monitor typical legal risks such as open-source license compliance, cross-border data flow, AI Act compliance evolution, and vendor lock-in mitigation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding GDPR, we has a no sensitive data processing default policy, but we can support Data Protection Impact Assessments (DPIAs) if needed." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

