    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For AI regulatory knowledge, we have expertise in AI Act and awareness of prohibited AI practices, limited risk AI transparency obligations, human oversight contractual enforcement, and a policy of no automated decision without human validation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the explicability and transparency requirements, we intellectual property default model is work-for-hire, where all deliverables are transferred to the client upon final payment. we also have source code escrow capability with Logitas (France) as we escrow provider, which could facilitate transparency in case of disputes or audits." ;
